# Build context for Frontend/Dockerfile.preview.
#
# The preview image is built from the console sources only: no dependency
# directory, no local build output and no environment file ever enters the
# image.  The test sources stay in the context because ``tsc -b`` compiles the
# same project as the CI frontend gate does.

node_modules
dist
coverage
frontend_docs
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
npm-debug.log*
